# Helm
# `helm dependency build` output — the vendored subchart tarball is a build
# artifact, not source. `Chart.lock` is committed instead: it pins the exact
# subchart version+digest, and `helm dependency build` reproduces the tarball
# from it on any machine.
kubernetes/*/charts/*.tgz
